<p>Hello,</p>

<p>
  Just a heads up: <%= @position.payee.display_name %>'s contract for
  "<%= @position.title %>" at <%= @event.name %> ends on
  <strong><%= @position.end_date.to_fs(:long) %></strong>.
</p>

<p>
  After that date, <%= @position.payee.display_name %> will no longer be able to
  submit invoices for this position. If you'd like them to keep working with
  <%= @event.name %>, you can set up a new contract before then. No action is
  needed if the engagement is wrapping up as planned.
</p>

<p>
  <%= link_to "View this contractor on HCB", event_payroll_position_url(@event, @position) %>
</p>

<p>
  Sincerely,
  <br><br>
  The HCB Team
</p>
